# golda voice-over — scripts/_vo/gen.py golda
# id | rate | pitch | text   (claims from seed-bnb-indo/monad-Golda-finance/VERIFY-BNB.md: the vault UI is a
# CONCEPT UI (no FE in repo) replaying the real BSC-testnet smoke run; LI.FI rebalance + TWAP ran on an anvil
# BSC MAINNET FORK only (no real-network writes); PAXG has no liquidity on BSC, so WBNB stood in for gold.
# "TWAP" spoken "tee-wap"; ERC-4626 not spoken.
voice = en-GB-RyanNeural
hook     | +12% | +0Hz | All dollars, then the market turns.
intro    | +8%  | -1Hz | Golda is a vault that hedges dollars into gold.
bnb      | +10% | -1Hz | Now on BNB Chain.
deposit  | +12% | -1Hz | Deposit USDT, get vault shares.
decide   | +14% | -1Hz | An agent reads the market and sets a gold target.
swap     | +18% | -1Hz | It swaps via LI.FI, whitelisted calls only.
guard    | +14% | -1Hz | Gold's priced off a five-minute average.
concept  | +21% | -1Hz | Concept UI, real testnet numbers.
minted   | +12% | -1Hz | A thousand in, a thousand shares out.
redeem   | +14% | -1Hz | Redeem four hundred. Six hundred stay put.
swapped  | +22% | -1Hz | Mainnet fork, not live: a thousand USDT became one point two seven seven wrapped BNB.
twap     | +14% | -1Hz | Wrapped BNB stands in for gold here.
honest   | +14% | -1Hz | PAXG has no liquidity on BSC today.
bug      | +16% | -1Hz | The fork caught a bug: those selectors don't exist on BSC.
fixed    | +14% | -1Hz | Twenty-four tests pass.
deploy   | +14% | -1Hz | Real testnet deploy: seven transactions, all status one.
smoke    | +12% | -1Hz | Then deposit and redeem, live.
stats    | +14% | -1Hz | Shares track deposits, one to one.
blocker  | +20% | -1Hz | Mainnet waits for a liquid PAXG pool on BSC.
outro    | -2%  | -2Hz | Golda. A treasury that hedges itself.
